        "id": 54333,
        "name": "IKerensky",
        "username": "IKerensky",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/df705f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-28T11:07:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Insula Primalis is clearly among the easiest one.</p><p>Obsidian +1 Damage help the heroes A LOT.</p><p>The T Rex and other can be used and abused as extra damage on the villains and villains target.</p><p>No real bad cards or unmanageable one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Megapolis have some cards that can just SCREW the heroes if drawn at a bad time (No cards draw when you need to discard).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rook City is among the hardest and the tomb of Anubis can sometimes get out of hand.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
