      {
        "id": 54334,
        "name": "Koey",
        "username": "Koey",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koey/{size}/2187_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-28T11:37:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"IKerensky\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/df705f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> IKerensky:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Rook City is among the hardest and the tomb of Anubis can sometimes get out of hand.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ah right remember we cycled through environment deck 1.5 times and had Anubis showed up 3-4 times while playing against Baron Blade with 3 players. In that scenario the Environment was just so much more dangerous than the boss itself.</p>",
