        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-28T14:09:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Why would Voss being under 15 make him a target for the T-Rex? The dino ignores itself, doesn't it? So Voss would still have been the highest and from the looks of it that would mean Ra would have been the target.</p>",
