      {
        "id": 54338,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-28T21:03:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I seem to recall that the T-Rex's card says that it deals \"the target, other than itself, with the second-highest hp\", meaning it ignores itself - if it has the second-highest hp out of everything, you ignore it and hit whatever has the next-highest hp instead (ie third-highest overall).</p>",
