        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-28T21:09:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It doesn't matter what hp the T-Rex has, you just ignore it entirely as it can never attack itself. I read the wording as \"Apart from the T-Rex, which target has the second-highest hp?\", meaning ignore the T-Rex.</p>",
