        "created_at": "2013-03-28T21:22:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is also a potential interpretation.</p><p>Basically, this game is to law students like methadone is to heroin addicts. For someone who's been trained specifically in interpreting text exactly the way you want it to be read, these cards are dangerous. (no surprise that my fellow law students love it?)</p>",
